# Agent loop

`Session` resolves the workspace and starts `messages` with `system_prompt`. `run` takes an injected client; production uses the lazy `get_client()` singleton.

Store model turns only through `assistant_message`: `role`, `content`, and `tool_calls` of `{id, type, function: {name, arguments}}`. Drop SDK extras such as `index`. Append tool results as `{"role": "tool", "tool_call_id", "content"}`.

Log one JSON object per line to `session.log` inside the workspace: `turn`, `model`, `tool_call` (truncate arg previews past 500 chars), `tool_result`. When `MAX_TURNS` is exhausted, append and return the assistant message `Max turns reached.` and log that model event.

Prompt contract: reads give the user the file content; writes confirm success without echoing content; deletes use `delete_file`; always confirm what was done. News calls `parse_page` with the article URL; summarize only the extracted text and confirm the URL. If the tool returns an error, report it. Do not paste the raw page or invent the article.

```python
# BAD: forwarding the raw SDK message
session.messages.append(msg.model_dump())

# GOOD: the stored shape tests assert
stored = {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": msg.content,
    "tool_calls": [{
        "id": tc.id,
        "type": "function",
        "function": {"name": tc.function.name, "arguments": tc.function.arguments},
    }],
}
```
